# Copy to `.env` (same folder) and edit. Never commit the real file.

# Required. Password of the database inside the Postgres container. Choose once, before the first
# start: Postgres only reads it when it creates ./data/postgres, so changing it later does not
# change the stored password.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME

# Optional. Host port the app is published on (default 8080).
#HAUPTBUCH_PORT=8080

# Optional. The address phones on your network use to reach the app, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8080
# (this machine's LAN IP and HAUPTBUCH_PORT). It is what the landing page's "Open on your phone" QR
# code encodes, and makes the panel appear even when you browse via localhost. Without it the QR
# uses whatever address your browser used. A DHCP-assigned IP can change — reserve it in your router.
#HAUPTBUCH_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=

# Optional. Anthropic API key fallback; normally you enter it in the app's Settings page instead.
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
